	"descriptionMarkdown": "Modular just paste more if needed. DO NOT overlap the belt.\n\nEach slice require 12.99 Yumako/s, 5.09 Jellynut/s and 5.38 Nutrients/s.\n\nAgriculture Tower equivalent Yumako 78 sector, Jellynut 31 sector.\n\nThe fresher the Yumako/Jellynut/Nutrient the better.\n\nSet-up:\n1) Left supply lane: Yumako (left side) and Nutrients (right side) (leave space for Seed output).\n2) Right supply lane: Jellynut (left side) and Nutrients (right side) (leave space for Seed output).\n3) Jump-start nutrients production by adding nutrient to the Bioflux to Nutrient Biochamber.\n4) Jump-start Pentapod Egg production by adding 2 Egg per Biochamber.\n5) Make sure the end of the supply lane doesn’t clog up on the Nutrient/Seed side.\n\nShould be self-sustaining.\n\nYou can replace Legendary Production module in the Science Biochamber with their equivalent of other quality. \n\nBe careful the 2 edge Science Biochamber have 1 Prod Mod 2 + 3 Prod Mod 3 instead on 4 Prod Mod 3.\n\nUsing Regular quality => 648 SPM\n\nLane set-up: https://imgur.com/fqe1gat\n\n**NOTE:\nThere might be some small  short hiccup now and then making the science production go down to 800, but it will go back to 840-ish within a few seconds, it's due to the Egg producer all pulling Nutrients at the very same time.If they didn't all startup at the very same time it shouldn't happen.**\n\n\nUpdate:\n\nFixed issue with inserter being too strict with ingredients/fuel.\n\nFixed Bioflux shortage.\n\nRemoved now useless recycler.\n\nIncreased ingredient requirement from 12.59 yumako to 12,99;  5 jellynut to 5.09; 5.25 Nutrient to 5.375.\n",
